<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115138" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυτρό-πους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stand for a pot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.5
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				893
			</span></i> (gloss on <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάσανα</span>); also
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυθρόπους</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
				46.269
			</span></i>, Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.222
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pot</i> or <i>cauldron,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυτρόποδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					748
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				11.35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. κέραμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>App.Anth.</u>
					5.29.5
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Juba</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τορύνη</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				509
			</span></i>:—
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυτρο-πόδιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				25
			</span></i>.</div>
